WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:03,340
Cousin Haoyu, let’s play the top-breaking game

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,640
Pei Jiaojiao, I didn’t expect you to support me.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,140
I play the role of Magic Pill and I play the role of Infinite Pioneer

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,640
You're too fat, you can't sit on it

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:15,120
Youyou is not fat because you have no strength

6
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,620
Cousin Haoyu, Youyou is so strong

7
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:22,220
How about the three of us play the role of Infinite Pioneer together? Really?

8
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:25,790
She can definitely lift us up

9
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:29,460
Right, Yoyo?

10
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,960
If you can't lift it, we won't play with you anymore

11
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:35,230
Yes, we can start

12
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:37,230
Hey, do you know the lines? I'll teach you.

13
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:40,030
Youyou know

14
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:42,030
Have you seen Nezha in the village?

15
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:44,030
I thought your village didn’t have internet access.

16
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:48,840
This is deep-rooted

17
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,840
You were born with a magic pill

18
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,840
It's all destined

19
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,120
Xiao Mowan, I promised to lift the three of us up.

20
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:01,120
Cousin, could she lie to us?

21
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:03,120
After all, she is a liar.

22
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:05,120
I hate lying the most

23
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:09,960
Then let's leave her alone

24
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:10,960
I have my destiny
